      "en": "The men of Babylon made Succoth Benoth, and the men of Cuth made Nergal, and the men of Hamath made Ashima,",
      "ko": "바벨론 사람들은 숙곳브놋을 만들었고 굿 사람들은 네르갈을 만들었고 하맛 사람들은 아시마를 만들었고",
      "source_text_hash": "1a7d69bea833a8b11b086054737a6f221c3c0c549712437a3657e0f035212fc6",
      "translation_text_hash": "6a56ff9ea16d3575ff7c71a43a7428b19c4cf43e97e0eb82381a7095b7d7ef47",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
